<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia posts $995.7 mln October trade surplus.</title>
<headline>Indonesia posts $995.7 mln October trade surplus.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia posted a trade surplus of $995.7 million in October, compared with $686.0 million in September, the Ministry for Industry and Trade said on Friday.</p>
<p>Following are the trade figures for October, in millions of dollars, with comparisons for the previous month and a year earlier:</p>
<p>			     October   September   October 95</p>
<p>    Trade balance	+995.7	+686.0	+509.0</p>
<p>    Exports	     4,463.66    4,331.00    3,900.00</p>
<p>    Imports	     3,468.03    3,645.00    3,391.00</p>
<p>    Oil/gas exports   1,132.43	954.00	791.60</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
